# Optional: explicitly select a slug from the active ChatGPT account's visible
# /v1/models catalog. Unset selects the first visible model in server order.
# List choices: mise exec -- pnpm --filter backend run codex:login --models
# CODEX_MODEL=slug-from-your-account-catalog

# Optional: dedicated runtime directory. Use the same value at login and serving.
# Default: ~/.local/share/elmethis/copilotkit-codex
# Protected SIWC registrations/tokens live in its siwc/ subdirectory.
# COPILOTKIT_CODEX_HOME=/absolute/path/to/copilotkit-codex

# No ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, or CODEX_API_KEY is needed.
# No automatic API-billing fallback is used.
# Authenticate with: mise run --silent copilotkit:login
# A new SIWC browser/PKCE login is required; old Codex auth.json is not imported.
# Device authorization (--device-auth) is not supported. For containers, log in
# locally and mount the protected directory read-write for the node user.
# Manage ChatGPT plan usage: https://chatgpt.com/settings/usage
